PROJECT CONTEXT — KHYRAT LEGAL CONTENT ENGINE
Snapshot: 2026-10-10
Repository: https://github.com/mr-romel/khyrat-legal-content-engine
Branch: main

MISSION
Automate Egyptian legal-content planning, writing, research, image generation, social publishing and engagement, short-form Reel creation, Telegram review, Blogger SEO/search-demand publishing, and marketplace operations.

NON-NEGOTIABLE SAFETY / CHANGE RULES
- Never put secret values, OAuth JSON, refresh tokens, browser cookies/storage state, service-account JSON, or API keys in docs, logs, prompts, or commits. Secret names only.
- Inspect current code, callers, workflows, and tests before changing/deleting files. Don't blindly remove code that may be workflow-invoked.
- A green Actions job is not proof of publication. Require a public permalink, platform post ID, or Telegram delivery confirmation.
- Make retries idempotent; look for an existing public post before creating another.
- Never bulk-delete Blogger drafts/posts without reviewing exact IDs, titles, bodies, and status.
- Free-tier quotas and provider availability change. Don't describe a provider as guaranteed free/reliable without current tests.

SCHEDULING CONTRACT
- Exactly one publishing slot per calendar day.
- Timezone Africa/Cairo; deterministic but variable hour per date, between 10:00 and 22:00 inclusive.
- No even/odd day filtering.
- Recycling means reusing a subject with a genuinely new angle, objective, hook, examples, or practical treatment—not copying old content.
- Key files: src/daily_schedule.py, src/recycler_rules.py, src/monthly_recycler.py, src/content_system_runtime.py, src/run_main.py.
- Acceptance: all dates represented once, no missing/duplicate dates, each hour within 10–22 Cairo, times vary, tests pass.

ARCHITECTURE MAP
GitHub Actions:
- publish-scheduled.yml: primary scheduled publisher.
- quality-check.yml: quality/architecture tests.
- blogger-publisher.yml: Blogger publication from the content source.
- blogger-demand-daily.yml: daily search-demand research and additional Blogger article.
- blogger-intelligence.yml, blogger-oauth-check.yml, blogger-pages.yml: Blogger diagnostics, intelligence, pages.
- reel-now.yml, reel-daily-generator.yml, reel-production.yml, reel-publish-approved.yml: Reel generation/review/production.
- Facebook engagement/reply/private-reply workflows and LinkedIn engagement/CI/dry-run/token diagnostics.
- Other workflows cover content intelligence, SEO/GEO, token health, Telegram control, video pilot/layers, deployment, and marketplace operations.

Core content:
- src/run_main.py, src/main.py, src/content_system.py, src/content_system_runtime.py.
- Planning/style/bank: src/content_planner.py, src/social_content.py, src/content_style.py, src/content_style_v3.py, src/post_bank.py, src/topic_bank*.py.
