PROMPT / IMAGE AUDIT
- For normal legal content use positive contemporary descriptions: present-day workplace/home, contract review, smartphone evidence, police-report preparation, modern law office/court corridor only when relevant; clean editorial photography or modern flat vector.
- Don't introduce ancient-history references into the positive prompt for routine legal content.
- Prompt edits alone are insufficient without checking provider, cache, and exact uploaded asset. QA must inspect the final output that will be published.

AI QUOTA / FALLBACKS
- src/gemini_resilience.py retries transient errors but intentionally fails fast on quota exhaustion.
- Changing model names may not avoid project-wide quota limits.
- Groq/OpenRouter free models/Cloudflare Workers AI are proposals until implemented and tested. Verify current access, limits, terms, required secrets, timeouts, provider provenance, and legal accuracy.
- Never fabricate statute numbers, case citations, or legal procedure when using fallback generation; ground substantive claims in verified legal sources.

